        You must extract EVERY piece of content from this document image (Page {{?page_num}} of {{?total_pages}}).

PART A: PAGE MARKER

**⚠️ YOUR FIRST OUTPUT LINE MUST BE:**
<!-- PAGE_START: {{?page_num}} of {{?total_pages}} -->

Begin EVERY response with this marker. No exceptions.

