--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C1. TEXT SECTION EXTRACTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**When to Apply:** Text paragraphs, executive commentary, bullet points, quotes, disclaimers, headlines

**Extraction Rules:**
- Extract text VERBATIM - do not summarize or paraphrase
